  "messages": {
    "welcome": {
      "image": "art/welcome.png",
      "text": [
        "## {info} What this is",
        "24/7 Shiny Hunting is a YouTube stream that never stops: **Pokémon Crystal**, played by **autocrystal**, a bot. The game is vanilla, it runs at normal speed, and there are no resets - every shiny you see happened live.",
        "",
        "## {ball} Where things are",
        "- <#stream-links> - watch the stream",
        "- <#shinies> - every shiny, perfect DV and 0/0/0/0, the moment it shows up",
        "- <#shiny-clips> - the best moments",
        "- <#readme> - how to run autocrystal yourself",
        "- <#bot-help> - questions about the bot",
        "- <#general> - chat",
        "",
        "## {info} Pings",
        "Nobody gets pinged unless they ask for it. Pick yours in **Channels & Roles** at the top of the channel list, and change them any time."
      ]
    },
    "rules": {
      "image": "art/rules.png",
      "text": []
    },
    "faq": {
      "image": "art/faq.png",
      "text": [
