        "- [What happens if a shiny runs away or faints?](<https://github.com/w0px/autocrystal-24-7-Shiny-Hunting/blob/main/FAQ.md#what-happens-if-a-shiny-runs-away-or-faints>)",
        "- [Why is it so slow?](<https://github.com/w0px/autocrystal-24-7-Shiny-Hunting/blob/main/FAQ.md#why-is-it-so-slow>)",
        "- [How long will it take?](<https://github.com/w0px/autocrystal-24-7-Shiny-Hunting/blob/main/FAQ.md#how-long-will-it-take>)",
        "- [Why does it go back to the same route so often?](<https://github.com/w0px/autocrystal-24-7-Shiny-Hunting/blob/main/FAQ.md#why-does-it-go-back-to-the-same-route-so-often>)",
        "- [Why does it run from some wild Pokémon?](<https://github.com/w0px/autocrystal-24-7-Shiny-Hunting/blob/main/FAQ.md#why-does-it-run-from-some-wild-pokémon>)",
